I mean, Holly's going to comment.

1083
00:46:48.520 --> 00:46:50.840
It looks like a fancy limousine driver's party.

1084
00:46:51.700 --> 00:46:51.940
Yes.

1085
00:46:52.300 --> 00:46:56.320
I had to know, what did it cost to host these parties?

1086
00:46:56.500 --> 00:46:59.440
What would Dunder Mifflin have spent on two full parties?

1087
