Per Randy, this party set decorating budget was around $6,000.

1092
00:47:11.280 --> 00:47:11.900
Wow.

1093
00:47:12.120 --> 00:47:13.120
For both parties.

1094
00:47:13.700 --> 00:47:18.580
And they had to be ready for duplicates because they were jumping around so much in the schedule.

1095
00:47:18.860 --> 00:47:22.860
We would go traditional Christmas to classy Christmas to traditional Christmas.

1096
00:47:23.200 --> 00:47:27.740
He even gave us the continuity pictures that our art department had to have so they made

1097
00:47:27.740 --> 00:47:29.140
sure they set everything up perfectly.

1098
00:47:29.140 --> 00:47:34.680
So, I got the call sheets from this, and I noticed exactly what you're talking about.

1099
00:47:35.060 --> 00:47:40.980
Not only, though, were we shooting these Christmas episodes with traditional and classy Christmas,

1100
00:47:40.980 --> 00:47:44.080
we were also shooting the episode ultimatum.

