00:47:44.200 --> 00:47:45.240
We were crossboarding?

1102
00:47:45.240 --> 00:47:46.840
Yes, at the same time.

1103
00:47:46.960 --> 00:47:48.800
This was because of Amy Ryan's schedule.

1104
00:47:49.060 --> 00:47:51.480
So, we had to group all of her work together.

1105
00:47:51.760 --> 00:47:58.640
In one day, we would go from traditional Christmas to classy Christmas to regular bullpen with

1106
00:47:58.640 --> 00:48:01.600
no Christmas and then back to a Christmas again.

1107
00:48:01.860 --> 00:48:02.220
Oh, my gosh.

1108
00:48:02.220 --> 00:48:04.900
And there would be little lines that would say, change over.

1109
00:48:05.080 --> 00:48:06.640
Change over to classy Christmas.

1110
00:48:06.740 --> 00:48:09.240
And we'd go off to the parking lot or something.

1111
00:48:09.240 --> 00:48:11.560
And they would have to redecorate all of that.

1112
00:48:11.560 --> 00:48:13.920
Like, four times in one day.

1113
00:48:14.060 --> 00:48:14.160
Wow.

1114
00:48:14.160 --> 00:48:15.400
It was bonkers.

1115
00:48:15.820 --> 00:48:16.140
Wow.

1116
00:48:16.720 --> 00:48:16.900
Geez.

1117
00:48:17.140 --> 00:48:19.680
See, those are those things we talk about that goes on behind the scenes.

1118
00:48:19.680 --> 00:48:21.860
That's just like, it just happens.

1119
00:48:22.040 --> 00:48:22.660
It just happens.

