Also, there would be a whole speech.

1212
00:52:41.680 --> 00:52:43.720
There will be an open flame.

1213
00:52:44.180 --> 00:52:44.600
Mm-hmm.

1214
00:52:44.740 --> 00:52:45.120
Mm-hmm.

1215
00:52:45.480 --> 00:52:48.780
