And also, I want to thank Jenny Tan over at Office Telly for gathering these great interviews

1704
01:15:23.060 --> 01:15:25.800
with our writers, our directors, our crew.

1705
01:15:26.060 --> 01:15:26.440
I know.

1706
01:15:26.600 --> 01:15:27.620
Jenny was the beSt.

1707
01:15:27.840 --> 01:15:28.040
Yeah.

1708
01:15:28.260 --> 01:15:28.720
Thank you.

1709
